  "body": " Series if for Letter Grades  public static void main(String[] args) { Scanner stdin; \/\/ For obtaining user input. double postTestScore; \/\/ User input; for determining the grade. char letterGrade; \/\/ The letter grade. \/\/ Obtain the post-test score. stdin = new Scanner(System.in); System.out.print(\"Enter the post-test score: \"); postTestScore = stdin.nextDouble(); stdin.close(); \/\/ Calculate the letter grade. if (postTestScore < 60) { letterGrade = 'F'; } else if (postTestScore < 70) { letterGrade = 'D'; } else if (postTestScore < 80) { letterGrade = 'C'; } else if (postTestScore < 90) { letterGrade = 'B'; } else { letterGrade = 'A'; } \/\/ Display the letter grade. System.out.println(\"The letter grade is \" + letterGrade + \".\"); }  "
