  "title": "Equivalent <code class=\"code-inline tex2jax_ignore\">for<\/code> and <code class=\"code-inline tex2jax_ignore\">while<\/code> loops",
  "body": " Equivalent for and while loops      while loop  for loop     seconds = 5; while (seconds > 0) { System.out.println(seconds + \"...\"); seconds--; }    for (seconds = 5; seconds > 0; seconds--) { System.out.println(seconds + \"...\"); }      int i = 0; while (i < 10) { System.out.println(\"Hello world!\"); i += 1; }    for (int i = 0; i < 10; i += 1) { System.out.println(\"Hello world!\"); }      int powerOfTwo = 1; while (powerOfTwo <= 16) { System.out.println(powerOfTwo); powerOfTwo *= 2; }    for (int powerOfTwo = 1; powerOfTwo <= 16; powerOfTwo *= 2) { System.out.println(powerOfTwo); }     "
