  "body": " MultiplicationTable.java  public class MultiplicationTable { public static void main(String[] args) { System.out.println(\" === 10x10 MULTIPLICATION TABLE ===\\n\"); \/\/ Outer loop controls the rows (1 through 10) for (int row = 1; row <= 10; row++) { \/\/ Inner loop controls the columns across the current row for (int col = 1; col <= 10; col++) { int product = row * col; \/\/ Print each product right-aligned in a 5-space column System.out.printf(\"%5d\", product); } \/\/ After all 10 columns are printed, advance to the next row System.out.println(); } } }  "
