  "body": " Loop test plan for ScoreAverager         Test Case  Category \/ Purpose  Input Stream  Expected Output  Pass \/ Fail    1   Zero Iterations  (Bypass \/ Immediate Sentinel: verifies no division by zero)   -1  No scores were entered.  Pass    2   One Iteration  (Single Item and verifies sentinel is not added to sum)   85, -1   Number of scores entered: 1  Average score : 85.00   Pass    3   Multiple Iterations  (Typical \/ Nominal Case)   80, 90, 100, -1   Number of scores entered: 3  Average score : 90.00   Pass    4   Lower Data Boundary  (Lowest Valid Score)   0, 0, -1   Number of scores entered: 2  Average score : 0.00   Pass    5   Upper Data Boundary  (Highest Valid Score)   100, 100, -1   Number of scores entered: 2  Average score : 100.00   Pass    "
