  "body": " Multi-Room Contractor Bid & Materials Invoice Generator   In Chapter 3, you calculated tile boxes and paint cans for a single room, applying warehouse volume discounts. In home renovation, contractors prepare bids for multi-room projects, totaling materials across all rooms and generating an itemized invoice.  Write a program that processes dimensions for an arbitrary number of rooms, either entered by the user or read from rooms.txt .   Program Requirements:    Input Loop: Prompt the user for the room name (e.g., \"Kitchen\" ), or \"done\" to finish. If valid, prompt for length, width, and ceiling height in feet (positive double values), along with the count of doors and windows ( int values).    Input Validation: Use a do-while loop for each dimension to enforce that length, width, and height are strictly greater than zero, re-prompting if invalid data is entered.    Room Calculations:   Floor Area: . Floor tiles cover per box at $16.50 per box. Use Math.ceil() to calculate whole boxes.  Net Wall Area: .  Paint Cans: Two coats of paint require 1-gallon cans ( per can for 2 coats) at $45.00 per can. Use Math.ceil() to calculate whole cans.     Loop Roles:   Stepper: Count total rooms ( roomCount ).  Gatherers: Accumulate total tile boxes, total paint cans, total floor area, and grand material cost.  Most-Wanted Holder: Identify the room requiring the largest surface area of paint.     File Output: Write the itemized estimate to contractor_bid.txt using PrintWriter , including a tiered contractor discount (10% off materials if grand subtotal exceeds $1,000.00).      Testing Requirement: Create a test plan covering zero rooms, a single room, a multi-room project qualifying for the discount, and boundary inputs (0 doors\/windows).  Here is an example of the program running:   Kitchen  14.0  12.0  9.0  2  1    Master Bedroom  18.0  15.0  10.0  2  3    done  ============================================================ PROJECT BID SUMMARY (2 Rooms Processed) ============================================================ Total Floor Area Covered : 438.00 sq ft Total Tile Boxes Ordered : 30 boxes ($495.00) Total Paint Cans Ordered : 6 cans ($270.00) Largest Painted Room : Master Bedroom Materials Subtotal : $765.00 Contractor Discount : $0.00 (Orders over $1,000 get 10%) Final Project Estimate : $765.00 ============================================================ Invoice saved to 'contractor_bid.txt'.    "
